  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "🏖️ Welcome to 89 Sand Dollar<br><br>Welcome to the newest gem in Seagrove Beach!<br><br>This stunning, newly constructed retreat has been thoughtfully designed to offer the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and spacious coastal living. Spanning four beautifully appointed levels—including three levels of luxurious living space and an expansive rooftop terrace—this home is the ideal beach getaway.<br><br>The rooftop terrace is a true highlight, complete with a cozy fire pit, breathtaking Gulf views, a bonus game room for kids, and a full poker set for evening fun. Located just 0.25 miles from the One Seagrove Beach Access, you'll also enjoy the convenience of a brand-new beach access point at New Seagrove Regional Beach Access—featuring restrooms and golf cart parking—less than 500 yards from your front door. <br><br>💛 We Make Your Stay Unforgettable<br><br>Prime Location – Quick golf cart or bike ride to the sugar-white sands of Seagrove Beach<br>Multiple Living Spaces – Perfect for large families or group getaways across three floors<br>Private Backyard Oasis – Enjoy a heated pool and spa, lush landscaping, and balcony views<br>Room for Everyone – 5 spacious bedrooms + a fun bunk room, comfortably sleeping up to 14 guests<br>Entertainment Galore – Rooftop fire pit lounge and game room with poker table for unforgettable nights in<br><br>Bonus Perks – Complimentary 6-seater golf cart and 6 bikes included with every stay<br><br>🛌 Dreamy Sleeping Arrangements & Layout<br><br>First Floor:<br>- Open-concept living, kitchen, and dining area for relaxing and entertaining<br>- Chef-style kitchen with stainless steel appliances and ample prep space<br>- King bedroom with easy access to a full bathroom (walk-in shower)<br>- Stylish half-bathroom for guests<br><br>Second Floor:<br>- Master Suite: King bed, en-suite bath, balcony access with backyard pool view<br>- King Bedroom 2: En-suite bathroom and balcony access<br>- King Bedroom 3: Steps from a shared full bath<br>- Laundry room with high-efficiency washer and dryer<br><br>Third Floor:<br>- Expansive Master Bedroom: King bed, spa-like en-suite with soaking tub, and large walk-in closet<br>- Bunk Room: Four built-in, XL Twin Bunk Beds (sleeps 8) with direct access to a balcony overlooking the pool<br><br>Stairway to elevated rooftop terrace with panoramic views. Roast s'mores by the fire or test your poker face while soaking in the scenic sunset views—all from your private rooftop escape.<br><br>👍 Just a Few More Perks<br>- Heated pool & spa ($75/night optional fee)<br>- Professionally managed by Live The Gulf Coast with 24/7 Guest Support<br><br>Pet Policy:<br>Pets are welcome with a non-refundable fee of $150 per pet (maximum of 2 pets allowed). Pets must be under 60 lbs, and breed restrictions apply. No cats.<br><br>🗓️ Important Info<br>Check-in Time: 4:00 PM<br>Check-out Time: 10:00 AM<br>Parking: Up to 3 vehicles<br>Age Requirement: At least 25 years old to book AND stay for non-family groups<br>Mid-stay clean: Required for 21+ night stays<br>Events: Must be approved in advance; unauthorized events are not allowed<br>Beach & Gear Rentals: For extra golf carts, bikes, beach setups, bonfires, and excursions, contact Live The Gulf Coast.<br>Cancellation Policy: No refunds on cancellations",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Elegant 6BR Seagrove Beach House w/ Heated Pool, Bikes & Golf Cart Included"
        }
      ],
